{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1024454-jante-s-law-and-the-get-of-fenris-how-much-human-culture-influences-garou-tribes","id":1024454,"title":"Jante's Law and the Get of Fenris (How Much Human Culture Influences Garou Tribes?)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-30T12:32:19-08:00","id":1024454,"title":"Jante's Law and the Get of Fenris (How Much Human Culture Influences Garou Tribes?)","content":"Hi, everybody,<br /> I play a Fenrir Metis Garou raised by Norwegian-Canadian Kinfolk with very strong connections to Norway (the Kinfolk are first-generation Canadians, their first language is Norwegian, they have a tradition of playing the Hardanger fiddle in their family, etc). While doing research on Norwegian culture, I came across Jante's Law (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Law_of_Jante\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Law_of_Jante</a>), which is apparently a strong force in Scandinavian societies and seems to fly in the face of Garou and particularly Get of Fenris values, who are all about performing deeds of strength and courage to boast about later and earn respect and Renown for. How do I mesh these two really different values together? How much do the human cultures geographic- and ethnic-based tribes like the Get of Fenris and Fianna are associated with influence those tribes? Do all the Garou and Kinfolk just subsume their human cultural values beneath that of the Garou and the tribe? Should I just ignore Jante's Law and play the stereotypical swaggering Nordic warrior or is there some way to incorporate something like Jante's Law into a Get of Fenris character?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12788,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12788-ruadhan","user":"Ruadhan","date":". 12-30-2016, 03:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12788-ruadhan","name":"Ruadhan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-30T12:45:27-08:00","id":1024460,"title":"","content":"Well, first off, your character doesn't ACTUALLY come from Norway. He comes from an immigrant family still. This is important, because Jante's Law needs enforcing by the whole community.<br /> <br /> As for how it fits the garou, garou are old. They tend to keep to traditions their human kin would have forgotten ages ago. One of them is boasting, naturally. I cannot speak for norway much, but here in Finland you sung your deeds and spells and the better you were the more impressive you were to your fellow men.<br /> <br /> Jante's Law doesn't touch that, because it relates to how you act near others typically. When telling stories (army stories here in Finland), you get a free pass.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-30T13:11:33-08:00","id":1024471,"title":"","content":"Well, I can certainly have a giggle at myself now. :-) I was assuming he would have been raised that way since his relatives came from Norway, but it sounds like it wouldn't happen, so I don't have to worry about it. This is why talking to someone from there will always trump research. Thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12788-ruadhan","name":"Ruadhan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-30T13:48:49-08:00","id":1024486,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ruadhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1024454-jante-s-law-and-the-get-of-fenris-how-much-human-culture-influences-garou-tribes?p=1024471#post1024471\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I can certainly have a giggle at myself now. :-) I was assuming he would have been raised that way since his relatives came from Norway, but it sounds like it wouldn't happen, so I don't have to worry about it. This is why talking to someone from there will always trump research. Thank you!</div> </div> </div> </div>Important thing is that you asked. And took it seriously.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-30T15:44:45-08:00","id":1024525,"title":"","content":"Garou cubs occur when puberty hits and the characters are still developing their mature personality. It is during the cub period that Garou culture and values are instilled - when the character is still open about learning about the world and preparing to be an adult. What little education and culture values they learned as homid children will go away because people always abandon childish behaviors that conflict with them becoming an adult.<br /> <br /> Only in cases where there is a Lost Cub and the character has a fully formed adult personality from human society is there going to be significant issues with adhering to Garou cultural values that don't match. And over time, Garou culture is likely to win because the Curse separates them from human society, and most social affirmation comes from other Garou.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-01T06:38:21-08:00","id":1025063,"title":"","content":"Law of Jante sounds like something the Get would like Kinfolk to aspire to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}